From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 06:30:40 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] kanban: the wake turn carries every notice the tui
 sibling still owes, so an uncovered status/quota/re-pin notice ahead of the
 completion no longer leaves the tui row to redeliver it after archive; the
 poller hands back a claim that raced a covered event

