 gateway/kanban_watchers_notifier.py           | 13 ++-
 .../test_kanban_notify_wake_one_turn.py       | 94 +++++++++++++++++++
 tui_gateway/session_notifications.py          |  6 ++
 4 files changed, 169 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

